      "message": "[error] Line 145: 🔴 `charAttrsAt()` always reads `index + 1`, which is out of range when the caret/selection start is at the end of the document. `selectionFormat()` and toolbar actions can hit this for an end-of-text caret, producing invalid cursor positioning and wrong toolbar state. Clamp to the last real character (or return an empty format for an empty document) before calling `setPosition()`.",
